research/audit/wave12-dispatch/audit-refuter-cex-mean-value-equality-fails-for-a-vector-valued-function.prompt.md-2275-  the integral clause needs no derivative; they are collected in one item because
research/audit/wave12-dispatch/audit-refuter-cex-mean-value-equality-fails-for-a-vector-valued-function.prompt.md-2276-  they are the two constructions of the one-dimensional theory that transfer to
